      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spectacularly Positioned 4 Bedroom Residence with Panoramic Sea Views from the Galley Head Lighthouse to The Stags Islands.\r\n\r\nThis Home offers one of the most scenic locations in the Glandore area, enjoying breathtaking Sea views as far as the eye can see, all while being only 2.5 Km from Glandore Village and 5 Km from Rosscarbery town. \r\n\r\nThe Residence extends to approximately 2,217 Sq.Ft. (c. 205 Sq.m) and comprises of Entrance Hall, Kitchen/Dining Area, Living Room, Office, Utility, W/C, Bathroom, and 2 bedrooms both featuring en suites on the ground floor. The first floor comprises of 2 Bedrooms with an en suite each. \r\n\r\nInternally, the Property is bright and airy due in part to the large windows and a wonderful open plan layout allowing this Home to take full advantage of it's South facing aspect.\r\n\r\nThis Home is situated upon a c. 0.5 Acre site which is laid out with lawn gardens, attractive stone entrance walls to match the front facade and a concrete base already laid for a garage. \r\n\r\nThis Home will qualify for the Vacant Property Grant (subject to conditions)\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended.\r\n\r\nServices: Private Drainage, Private Water, Broadband, Oil-Heating"
      },
